  "slug": "apartment-move-out-inspection-form",
  "title": "Apartment Move-Out Inspection and Turnover Record",
  "subtitle": "Document departure scheduling, observable unit condition, evidence, keys and utilities, comparison references, resident comments, turnover decisions, exceptions, and accountable handoff.",
  "description": "A workflow-complete apartment move-out inspection record covering lease and unit identity, inspection access, room-by-room observations, photo references, utility readings, returned access devices, remaining property, turnover actions, resident comments, and management closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use when property staff and a departing resident need a factual, reviewable move-out condition record that supports turnover planning while keeping repair decisions, financial review, disputed observations, and legal conclusions in their proper separate workflows.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
